# WS4-08 expectation for 420-flags.py, written before the run. Sources: 03-02 WS4-08
# and 03-01 §Measurement rules (flag findings compare two flag sets and state both;
# 68020 numbers are a 68020 probe build, never above Opportunity); GCC documentation
